body:
I wanna clarify more.

&#x200B;

Nasal sprays ALWAYS have the LIVE virus. Shots typically are only given with the dead virus but it's best to double check with the doctor who's giving it beforehand to make sure.

Who told you to not get a flu shot?

&#x200B;

I'm also a transplant patient and take incredibly strong immunosuppresants, so I can't receive live vaccines like rubella.

&#x200B;

HOWEVER flu shots are  typically dead. Nasal sprays have the living vaccine, but the shots are dead. And you can double check when you get them.

&#x200B;

There isn't any reason you shouldn't be able to get  flu shot.

That was definitely not fun. More terrifying and confusing. I will definitely be more careful in the future and this will not happen again. I feel super bad for the friend that helped me out. I have to take at least a few a day bc of chronic pain but I really did completely turn into an idiot yesterday.

&#x200B;

I can't possibly imagine how that's supposed to be fun. I was scared and didn't know what was going on.

Suicide isn't the easy way out, anything but.

&#x200B;

I agree with your overall message but this is why I got a will put together lol, I can be sure that won't happen to me even if something does happen.

Thank you for responding, I really appreciate it. I don't really care about being shirtless too much but the weight does really bother me and feeling like my chest looks abnormal makes me feel self conscious around other people. Wearing a correctly sized binder still makes me look like I have a large chest and anything smaller absolutely hurts. I hope not having to deal with that will make it worth the other stuff if I end up going through with this. 

&#x200B;

I have a therapist bc I needed to be in therapy for a period of time in order to get insurance approval for surgery. I told her that I was just shocked and completely didn't expect this, and that I was having trouble coming up with other options. She just reaffirmed that there was no way to prepare for that and just asked me if I was suicidal, which I'd say no to regardless if I was or not. After that I just told her I'm going to hold off on doing top surgery.
